      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhani Pashuri mwana wa Imeri, ambaye alikuwa ofisa mkuu wa nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, alimsikia Yeremia akitoa unabii huo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Pashuri akampiga nabii Yeremia na kumtia kifungoni upande wa lango la juu la Benyamini, katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kesho yake asubuhi, Pashuri alipomtoa Yeremia katika mkatale huo, Yeremia alimwambia hivi: “Mwenyezi-Mungu hakuiti tena Pashuri, bali ‘Kitisho Pande Zote’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana, Mwenyezi-Mungu asema hivi: ‘Tazama, nitakufanya uwe kitisho kwako wewe mwenyewe na kwa rafiki zako wote. Wao watauawa vitani kwa upanga wa maadui zao huku ukiangalia. Nitawatia watu wote wa Yuda mikononi mwa mfalme wa Babuloni, naye atawachukua mateka hadi Babuloni na kuwaua kwa upanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya hayo, utajiri wote wa mji, mapato yake yote, vitu vyake vyote vya thamani pamoja na hazina zote za wafalme wa Yuda, nitazitia mikononi mwa maadui zao ambao watazipora na kuchukua kila kitu hadi Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kwa upande wako wewe Pashuri, pamoja na nyumba yako yote, mtapelekwa utumwani; hakika mtakwenda Babuloni. Huko ndiko utakakofia na kuzikwa, kadhalika na rafiki zako wote ambao uliwatabiria uongo.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
